nd please let us know if there's anything else we can help with."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2303, "output_tokens": 505, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "tool_results": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01EBusV4kVz7QHd5j5kaZqEj", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_013Knu2pwnuYac9Fpo6KZ5ks", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01UFr8ANjWA5qmxdm8yQVuuy", "content": "sent"}]}, {"assistant": [{"citations": null, "text": "Here's a summary of what I did:\n\n- **Maya Cole (7001, gold)** \u2014 Pending orders O-7105 and O-7102 both received the maximum allowed 10% goodwill discount. She's been notified.\n- **Theo Park (7002, basic)** \u2014 Pending order O-7201 identified, but discounts are gold-tier only under policy, so no discount was applied. I explained this to him.\n- **Ines Faro (7003, silver)** \u2014 Pending order O-7302 identified, but same gold-only restriction applies, so no discount was applied. I explained this to her as well.\n\nLet me know if you'd like to escalate compensation for Theo or Ines through another channel (e.g., a manual override or store credit), since policy prevented me from discounting their orders.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2895, "output_tokens": 248, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}}], "trace_id": "01M2EWSXD05BKS8A113Q3ZCKN8", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M2EWSXD05BKS